{
  "id": "p43",
  "title": "After the Flood",
  "titleZh": "洪水之后",
  "topic": "洪灾救援与重建",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Our committee meets tonight to announce a new aid plan.",
        "zh": "我们的委员会今晚开会，宣布一项新的援助计划。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A massive flood ruined the agricultural land below our town.",
        "zh": "一场大洪水毁掉了我们镇下游的农田。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The subject shocks every family, and the pain feels real.",
        "zh": "这个话题让每家每户都震惊，痛苦也真切可感。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a broad settlement lies underwater, and help arrives very slowly.",
        "zh": "接着，一大片定居点泡在水里，救援来得非常慢。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Each cell of the temporary camp holds four wet beds.",
        "zh": "临时营地的每个隔间里放着四张湿床。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We are aware of the risk, yet the structure still stands.",
        "zh": "我们清楚有风险，但这座建筑依然立着。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A troop of young volunteers brings clean clothing and food.",
        "zh": "一队年轻志愿者带来了干净的衣物和食物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A neighbour helps us bury a wet tissue box and some old books.",
        "zh": "一位邻居帮我们埋掉一个湿透的纸巾盒和几本旧书。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We negotiate with one enterprise for a daily water supply.",
        "zh": "我们与一家企业协商，争取每日供水。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The upper road stays open, so a small payment passes.",
        "zh": "上方的道路仍然通着，所以一小笔款项能送过去。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My cousin helps propose a transfer of tents and blankets.",
        "zh": "我的表亲帮忙提议调拨帐篷和毯子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A mobile clinic stops an infected cut before it spreads at all.",
        "zh": "一辆流动诊所车在感染扩散之前处理了伤口。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A socialist member moves to resist the new safety rules.",
        "zh": "一位社会主义派成员动议抵制新的安全规定。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A critic broadcasts a short report about the camp.",
        "zh": "一位批评家在广播里做了一段关于营地的简短报道。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We label the plan bold, and the caption draws quiet laughs.",
        "zh": "我们把这计划称为大胆之举，说明文字引来几声轻笑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A revolutionary passion runs through the whole long town meeting.",
        "zh": "一种革命般的热情贯穿了整场漫长的镇民会议。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the board reads the document and explores a new idea.",
        "zh": "后来董事会读了这份文件，并探讨了一个新想法。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Their conclusion is clear, and the equity gap looks huge.",
        "zh": "他们的结论很明确，而公平上的差距看起来很大。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My old rescue team brings steady help to every street.",
        "zh": "我原来的救援队给每条街带来稳定的帮助。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The beauty of the old bridge hides damage at the rear.",
        "zh": "老桥的美观掩盖了后部的损坏。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A priest and a delegate open the shelter at noon.",
        "zh": "一位神父和一位代表中午开放了避难所。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My neighbour files a motion, whilst the council keeps silent.",
        "zh": "我的邻居提交了一项动议，而议会保持沉默。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then workers convert a school into a home for each hostage.",
        "zh": "接着工人们把一所学校改成每名受困者的住所。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A premium price could trigger a rush for dry land.",
        "zh": "高价可能引发对干燥土地的一轮抢购。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The coming fiftieth anniversary draws a quiet crowd outside the hall.",
        "zh": "即将到来的五十周年纪念把一群人静静引到礼堂外。"
      },
      {
        "en": "New legislation will actually fund the whole repair work.",
        "zh": "新的立法将真正为整项修复工程出资。"
      },
      {
        "en": "That fantasy of a quick fix looks calculated and cheap.",
        "zh": "那种快速解决的幻想显得精于算计又廉价。"
      },
      {
        "en": "In reality, this transition is bound to bring an invasion of aid.",
        "zh": "现实中，这一转变必然会带来大量援助的涌入。"
      }
    ]
  ],
